Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.65,0:00:14.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I'm with Bamboo Productions.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.65,0:00:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you considered a career in entertainment?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or are you signed with a talent agency—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.15,0:00:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.25,0:00:21.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.75,0:00:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.93,0:00:29.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was up with that lady?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.60,0:00:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She wanted to know if I'm interested in\Nbeing a model or a performer.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.13,0:00:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get asked that sometimes.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.49,0:00:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello there! Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.38,0:00:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sunohara!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.38,0:00:41.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And don't you look lovely today, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.71,0:00:44.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh please. Flattery won't\Nget me to buy anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.67,0:00:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perceptive one, isn't she?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.63,0:00:51.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seems like Bell's gotten used to\Nthe way things work in this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.50,0:02:02.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,G'morning, Sunohara! G'morning, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something feels off today...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.93,0:02:08.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems like everyone's staring at Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.43,0:02:10.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I might know why.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.43,0:02:11.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that me...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.43,0:02:11.69,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Is that Bell...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.69,0:02:16.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Articles like this one get posted\Neverywhere after SunComi.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.10,0:02:20.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are those love letters?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.94,0:02:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's because I don't have one of those\N"smartphones" or whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.29,0:02:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You hardly see those nowadays...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.38,0:02:29.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Guess it just goes to show how serious—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.20,0:02:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.83,0:02:33.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This crap is annoying.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.87,0:02:36.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata's the only person I care about.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.26,0:02:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But don't you feel a little bad for them?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not my problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.53,0:02:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in anyone\Nexcept you, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.96,0:02:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The day I look another man's way\Nis the day Hell freezes over.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.50,0:02:51.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To me, there are two types of men\Nin the world: Hinata and other.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.34,0:02:54.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's obsessed...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.68,0:03:00.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and I might as well\Nflaunt our relationship at school, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.80,0:03:05.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That way, all these annoying little pests\Nwon't try to get near either of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.73,0:03:08.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, it'll bring us closer.\NTwo birds, one stone!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.40,0:03:09.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.66,0:03:11.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.41,0:03:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Homeroom's about to start!\NSee ya there!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.17,0:03:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait—!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.66,0:03:18.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.00,0:03:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, this sucks...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My shoulders feel like they're falling off...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.23,0:03:33.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.73,0:03:35.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sakura?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's your bra?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.51,0:03:37.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not wearing one. Too stuffy.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.93,0:03:38.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have to!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.01,0:03:39.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.93,0:03:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mere, I'll shield you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.85,0:03:47.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's all for today.\NGym helpers, collect the soccer balls.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.27,0:03:49.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.46,0:04:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.50,0:04:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.42,0:04:04.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Bell—!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.28,0:04:07.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ran a whole bunch, and now I'm tired.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.84,0:04:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's take a breather!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.17,0:04:12.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't! I have to get back to class—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.09,0:04:14.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really? You're still using that excuse?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You ran away from me this morning, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.30,0:04:21.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...now you're trapped and can't escape!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.68,0:04:23.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-You're sweaty.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.11,0:04:25.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.14,0:04:28.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't... smell bad, do I?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.12,0:04:29.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that's not...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.98,0:04:31.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You always smell nice, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.87,0:04:33.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.19,0:04:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.34,0:04:46.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-My bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.85,0:05:00.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! I just...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.72,0:05:02.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.26,0:05:05.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All of me belongs to you, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.99,0:05:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, we shouldn't be doing this!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.94,0:05:20.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to go get changed!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.44,0:05:21.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.55,0:05:23.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, no you don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.83,0:05:28.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell? Are you finished putting away the—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.56,0:05:32.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.56,0:05:32.43,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Mochida?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.09,0:05:37.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'll untie you right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.40,0:05:42.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, open wide.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.51,0:05:43.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Consider it an apology.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.47,0:05:49.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's tasty!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.66,0:05:53.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it? Hinata made my lunch himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.11,0:05:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, Hinata, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.18,0:05:58.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Feed me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.54,0:06:01.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell! People are staring at us...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.44,0:06:04.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh please. Quit using that lame excuse\Nto try and run away from me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.80,0:06:08.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not "running away," I'm just...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.20,0:06:11.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry to interrupt!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.87,0:06:15.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, Bell, about what we discussed\Nthe other day...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.02,0:06:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, y'mean helping out with club activities?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.92,0:06:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. My senpai's here too,\Nso can we at least have a chat?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.43,0:06:24.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat without me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.43,0:06:26.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.78,0:06:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry for dragging you away.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.05,0:06:33.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell's changed a little bit, hasn't she?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.40,0:06:34.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.45,0:06:38.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before, she had her walls up\Nand wouldn't let anyone get near her
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.17,0:06:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,except for you, Sunohara.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.88,0:06:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But lately, she's been pretty friendly\Nand approachable.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.36,0:06:45.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well... with the other girls, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.87,0:06:49.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the most part, it seems like\Nshe's adjusted to life in our world.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.16,0:06:53.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.16,0:06:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it's really great...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.46,0:07:04.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heading home at last...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.47,0:07:06.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.18,0:07:08.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hinata? For dinner tonight—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.65,0:07:09.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.80,0:07:12.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do I know you...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can we help you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.85,0:07:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I... Ever since I first laid\Neyes on you, Mariabell,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.83,0:07:22.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been in l-love with you...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.11,0:07:27.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I wrote you several letters,\Nbut you burned them all...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.03,0:07:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I need you to know how I feel...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.92,0:07:33.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please be my girlfriend!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.38,0:07:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.46,0:07:40.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.06,0:07:45.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...I'm in love with Hinata,\Nso I can't reciprocate your feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.39,0:07:47.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh... I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.97,0:07:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.30,0:07:52.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.03,0:07:57.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-Um... Thank you for hearing me out!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.02,0:08:00.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.63,0:08:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll go ahead and clean up.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.33,0:08:13.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The bath should be warming up now.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.09,0:08:22.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.02,0:08:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's gotten into you, Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.13,0:08:28.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mm, it looked to me\Nlike you were lost in thought.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.86,0:08:30.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me guess...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.39,0:08:33.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were worried someone might\Nswoop in and steal me?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.05,0:08:35.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?! That's not...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.80,0:08:39.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're fitting in here really well, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.04,0:08:42.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...you're improving more and more...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.25,0:08:45.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should be happy, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.81,0:08:48.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,for some reason, it makes me anxious...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.71,0:08:52.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just... maybe I'm being an idiot, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.20,0:08:55.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like you're drifting\Nfurther away or something...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.83,0:08:59.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, don't think like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.29,0:09:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't have faith in me, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.67,0:09:08.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, how sad! I'm incredibly wounded!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.85,0:09:10.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.26,0:09:12.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.47,0:09:13.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.49,0:09:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.58,0:09:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...you know the best way to\Nease my mind, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.50,0:09:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to feel as though I belong\Nto you, Hinata. Body and soul.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.69,0:09:30.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes! It's finally happening!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata and I will be together at last!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.72,0:09:37.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I put in a lot of hard work to make him happy,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.28,0:09:39.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and now all the pieces are in place!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.72,0:09:42.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.73,0:09:50.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-Was that good?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.74,0:09:54.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,NO!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.39,0:09:57.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It should be hotter! Deep! Unrelenting!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.60,0:09:58.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Unrelenting"?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.85,0:10:01.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That measly little kiss doesn't\Nmake me feel better at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.35,0:10:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.55,0:10:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ugh, give me your hand!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.92,0:10:10.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you want me to feel better,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.91,0:10:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you have to touch me like this...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to hold back.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.79,0:10:32.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.05,0:10:35.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.15,0:10:40.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey—! Hinata?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.01,0:10:42.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, you're sorry?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.66,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Bell! Right now, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.19,0:10:43.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did I do something to upset you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.66,0:10:46.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before I can ease your mind, I need to be...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.73,0:10:48.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.56,0:10:55.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the right place...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.86,0:10:59.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...and with the right words...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.98,0:11:03.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to be more clear about my feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.43,0:02:10.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs46\c&HCF6563&\pos(154,108)}A Real Dark Elf?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.43,0:02:10.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs46\c&HCF6563&\pos(154,184)}Mysterious Cosplay Babe Sighted!!
